{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"rich_text_Cmtykc":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_RF696E":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>We’re on a mission to turn everyday play into magical learning experiences. We create interactive activity kits that blend creativity, sensory exploration, and hands-on fun transforming playtime into a moment of discovery, imagination, and joy for children.<\/strong><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_RF696E"],"custom_css":["p {font-size: 17px;}"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"visibility":"always-display","desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52,"custom_colors_background":"#FFFFFF","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2E2A39","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff"}},"multirow_3ACVDq":{"type":"multirow","blocks":{"row_DGiL47":{"type":"row","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/71AhGUb7M0L.jpg","caption":"","heading":"","text":"<p>Paint & Bloom is rooted in the belief that curiosity is the foundation of learning. We believe children learn best when they’re encouraged to ask questions, test ideas, and see results for themselves. Play isn’t just entertainment it’s how confidence, creativity, and problem-solving skills are built.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"row_ida3XH":{"type":"row","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/71iHmQWn93L.jpg","caption":"","heading":"","text":"<p>We’re not just creating toys we’re creating experiences. Each Water Elf Kit turns simple materials into something exciting, encouraging kids to think, experiment, and discover how things work. From first creation to final result, every step is part of the fun.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"row_KMXiXg":{"type":"row","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/